+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

To execute CoW on OpenBSD, copy the example configurations to your ~/.config
directory (or XDG_CONFIG_HOME) first:

$ cp ${LOCALBASE}/share/examples/cow/cow.conf ~/.config/cow/
$ cp ${LOCALBASE}/share/examples/cow/river/init ~/.config/river/

CoW may then be started via:

$ river

For a tested waybar configuration, refer to ${LOCALBASE}/share/examples/waybar
